                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm sorry but this game is just not very high quality. It is impossible to get the all stars achievement since the last (bonus) level is missing 5 bugs and the game has its fair share of bugs. I'm not even that bothered by that last part since the level is so difficult to do hitless (not a skill hitless but a pass this bs part hitless) and in the time requirement that I'm not sure if its possible. Most obvious to me was that if you hit esc fast enough on the menus you go to a limbo like state where all you can do is alt F4 as you're locked in a void. Another bad one is that if you go quick enough down against something blowing air up you can fall through it and actually just fall out of the map. I had that happen several time without trying and its really annoying. The achievement for having taken a screenshot on that buggy level with the fidget spinners also didn't trigger so I guess no work was put into playtesting. Thankfully with the guides (like mine :3) you can get the other achievements without much work. Overall this game really isn't that enjoyable but for 5 bucks it's not the end of the world",
